# MODAL-02 — Accessible name

## Rationale

Dialogs must be labelled via `aria-label` or `aria-labelledby`.

## How to check

```bash
bun "<skill-dir>/scripts/cli.ts" check modals-dialogs <file>
```

## How to fix

Propose `aria-labelledby` pointing at the dialog title.
